url: "https://github.com/Sangeeth0301/Physics-Informed-Quantum-Reservoir-Transformer-for-Bearing-SHM"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid quantum-classical machine learning architecture for ultra-early
  detection of incipient rotational faults in rolling element bearings.
  The system fuses Multi-Resolution Dynamic Mode Decomposition (mrDMD),
  Entangled Quantum Hilbert Kernels (PQKR), Temporal Transformer Attention,
  and a Continuous Physics-Informed Neural ODE (PINN) constrained by
  Hertzian contact mechanics to produce a continuous Instability Score (SI)
  that provides early warning before fault frequencies appear in the spectrum.
